The game binary is -rwsr-xr-x in the default installation.
In other words, try
chmod u+s /usr/games/lib/nethackdir/nethack
to set the suid bit, that should help. The directory and all the files are
owned by the games user and the bin group (though the groups shouldn't
matter when the game binary is suid games).
The users don't need to be in the games group.

